title: "Code for modelling vortex interactions in antidepressant brain reconfiguration"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-18"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alvaroacostagordo/vortex-wbm-psilocybin-escitalopram"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and Python code for subject-specific whole-brain modelling in signal
  and vortex spaces and for the downstream machine-learning, regional global
  brain connectivity, connectome-based clinical association, network modularity, and
  brain-turbulence analyses reported in the associated manuscript.
keywords:
  - major depressive disorder
  - whole-brain modelling
  - effective connectivity
  - brain turbulence
  - modularity
  - machine learning
  - psilocybin
  - escitalopram
